      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i'll skip the glue then. about the doctor thing, i honestly had my last tetanus shot like 10 years ago so i think i'm probably fine? it's just a small hole, i dont think it's a big deal. i'll just do the gauze and keep moving. anything else i can take or do at home to make sure it doesn't get nasty since i can't leave the job site?",
